  "correctValue": "1",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>X</mi><mi>B</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mtable columnalign=\"left\"><mtr><mtd><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mfrac><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mi>k</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mtable columnalign=\"left\"><mtr><mtd><msub><mi>b</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><msub><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></msub></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mtable columnalign=\"left\"><mtr><mtd><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mtable columnalign=\"left\"><mtr><mtd><msub><mi>b</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><msub><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>k</mi><msub><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>b</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>b</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>k</mi><msub><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced></math></p><p>Given,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mfenced><mrow><msubsup><mi>b</mi><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><msup><mo>)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mo>)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>b</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>b</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>k</mi><msub><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mfenced><mrow><msubsup><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><msubsup><mi>b</mi><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>k</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mn>3</mn></mfrac><msubsup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><msub><mi>b</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mfenced><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Given,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><msubsup><mi>b</mi><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><msubsup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup></math></p><p>On comparing we get</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>k</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>k</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>&#177;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mfenced><mn>3</mn></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>(</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mfenced><mn>4</mn></mfenced></math></p><p>From both we get&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p>",
